Hi,

this patch adds a runtime togglable option (just below "color") for
toggling your characters Line of sight.

So *you* can see where your *character* can see ;)

find the patch here :
  http://www.linuxgames.co.za/NetHack/patches/#los

one minor "issue" however.
it seems that NetHack's internal line of sight algorithm shows room walls
which you have already visited and are already on your map as being in
your line of sight even when viewed down an as yet unexplored passageway.

this i would consider a cheat :(

as if you are heading down an *unexplored* passage towards an already
visited room, and the passage happens to run directly to that room, then
that rooms walls will be shown as "visible" within the LOS.

